# ==============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES CONFIGURATION (OPTIONAL / REFERENCE)
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: This portfolio is currently built as static HTML/CSS/JS.
# Configuration is managed directly within index.html:
# - FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT: https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID
# - TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY: YOUR_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY
#
# If you ever migrate to a frontend bundler (e.g. Vite), use PUBLIC variables only:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=your_form_id_here
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=your_turnstile_public_site_key_here
#
# CRITICAL SECURITY RULE:
# NEVER place private credentials in this file or any frontend code!
# - Formspree Private API Keys / Secret Tokens -> Never expose to client
# - Cloudflare Turnstile SECRET Key -> Configure ONLY in Formspree Dashboard
#   (Form Settings -> Spam Protection / CAPTCHA -> Cloudflare Turnstile)
# ==============================================================================
